;. /project_result_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition project_result
  ;= Project a native result into Nenex
    This is an optional document projection. Use the Nenex writer. The original result and captures remain in the producing flow; this projection neither invokes actions nor changes them.

    ;@ /flow/input value
    ;= value

    ;@ /flow/step pages ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/project
    ;@ /flow/bind value value
    ;= pages

    ;@ /flow/result pages
    ;= Project a native result into Nenex result
